            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Integrity: Uripath abbrev retransmit payload loss. Categories: Data integrity. Weaknesses: CWE-670."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Integrity: Uripath abbrev retransmit payload loss. Categories: Data integrity. Weaknesses: CWE-670.\n\n## Remediation\n\nCall coap_add_data(new, data_len, data) and handle failure by deleting new and returning an error. If the duplicate helper is expected to preserve payload, extend it to copy data explicitly.",
                "text": "Integrity: Uripath abbrev retransmit payload loss. Categories: Data integrity. Weaknesses: CWE-670.\n\nRemediation:\n\nCall coap_add_data(new, data_len, data) and handle failure by deleting new and returning an error. If the duplicate helper is expected to preserve payload, extend it to copy data explicitly."
              },
              "id": "integrity.uripath-abbrev-retransmit-payload-loss",
              "name": "Integrity: Uripath abbrev retransmit payload loss",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "2.0",
