                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Integrity: Uripath abbrev retransmit payload loss"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Memory disclosure: Block1 uninitialized reassembly. Categories: Information disclosure. Weaknesses: CWE-200, CWE-457."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Memory disclosure: Block1 uninitialized reassembly. Categories: Information disclosure. Weaknesses: CWE-200, CWE-457.\n\n## Remediation\n\nZero-initialize the body allocation, or track received byte ranges and reject any Block1 sequence with a gap or overlap. Compute offsets from the SZX established for the transfer and require each segment to start at the next expected byte.",
                "text": "Memory disclosure: Block1 uninitialized reassembly. Categories: Information disclosure. Weaknesses: CWE-200, CWE-457.\n\nRemediation:\n\nZero-initialize the body allocation, or track received byte ranges and reject any Block1 sequence with a gap or overlap. Compute offsets from the SZX established for the transfer and require each segment to start at the next expected byte."
              },
              "id": "memory-disclosure.block1-uninitialized-reassembly",
              "name": "Memory disclosure: Block1 uninitialized reassembly",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "external/cwe/cwe-200",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-457",
                  "information-disclosure",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Memory disclosure: Block1 uninitialized reassembly"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Oscore b2 cbor off by one. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-193, CWE-787."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Memory safety: Oscore b2 cbor off by one. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-193, CWE-787.\n\n## Remediation\n\nPass rem_space - 1 to oscore_cbor_put_bytes() and require rem_space > 1; check nb + kid_context.length against the true remaining capacity, guard the rem_space decrement against underflow, and derive the next offset from the bounded return value.",
                "text": "Memory safety: Oscore b2 cbor off by one. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-193, CWE-787.\n\nRemediation:\n\nPass rem_space - 1 to oscore_cbor_put_bytes() and require rem_space > 1; check nb + kid_context.length against the true remaining capacity, guard the rem_space decrement against underflow, and derive the next offset from the bounded return value."
              },
              "id": "memory-safety.oscore-b2-cbor-off-by-one",
              "name": "Memory safety: Oscore b2 cbor off by one",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "external/cwe/cwe-193",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-787",
                  "memory-corruption",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Oscore b2 cbor off by one"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Oscore recipient null deref. Categories: Null pointer dereference. Weaknesses: CWE-476."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Memory safety: Oscore recipient null deref. Categories: Null pointer dereference. Weaknesses: CWE-476.\n\n## Remediation\n\nInitialize *recipient_ctx = NULL at the start of the callback path and return NULL when no recipient matches, freeing the temporary context. Reject the request when osc_ctx is non-NULL but rcp_ctx is NULL before storing or dereferencing the recipient.",
                "text": "Memory safety: Oscore recipient null deref. Categories: Null pointer dereference. Weaknesses: CWE-476.\n\nRemediation:\n\nInitialize *recipient_ctx = NULL at the start of the callback path and return NULL when no recipient matches, freeing the temporary context. Reject the request when osc_ctx is non-NULL but rcp_ctx is NULL before storing or dereferencing the recipient."
              },
              "id": "memory-safety.oscore-recipient-null-deref",
              "name": "Memory safety: Oscore recipient null deref",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
