                  "null-pointer-dereference",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Oscore recipient null deref"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Pdu 408 unchecked marker. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-787."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Memory safety: Pdu 408 unchecked marker. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-787.\n\n## Remediation\n\nCheck both coap_add_token() and coap_add_option_internal() results. Call coap_pdu_check_resize(pdu, pdu->used_size + 1) before writing the marker; on failure, delete the PDU and return NULL so the caller defers the 4.08.",
                "text": "Memory safety: Pdu 408 unchecked marker. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-787.\n\nRemediation:\n\nCheck both coap_add_token() and coap_add_option_internal() results. Call coap_pdu_check_resize(pdu, pdu->used_size + 1) before writing the marker; on failure, delete the PDU and return NULL so the caller defers the 4.08."
              },
              "id": "memory-safety.pdu-408-unchecked-marker",
              "name": "Memory safety: Pdu 408 unchecked marker",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "2.0",
                "tags": [
                  "external/cwe/cwe-787",
                  "memory-corruption",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Pdu 408 unchecked marker"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Websocket close stack overflow. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-121, CWE-787."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Memory safety: Websocket close stack overflow. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-121, CWE-787.\n\n## Remediation\n\nClamp the continuation read to min(data_size - data_ofs, datalen) and reject the frame if it cannot fit; in coap_ws_close(), size the drain buffer for the maximum accepted frame or do not call coap_ws_read with a smaller buffer.",
                "text": "Memory safety: Websocket close stack overflow. Categories: Memory corruption. Weaknesses: CWE-121, CWE-787.\n\nRemediation:\n\nClamp the continuation read to min(data_size - data_ofs, datalen) and reject the frame if it cannot fit; in coap_ws_close(), size the drain buffer for the maximum accepted frame or do not call coap_ws_read with a smaller buffer."
              },
              "id": "memory-safety.websocket-close-stack-overflow",
              "name": "Memory safety: Websocket close stack overflow",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
