                  "memory-corruption",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Memory safety: Websocket close stack overflow"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Oscore b2 unbounded contexts. Categories: Resource exhaustion. Weaknesses: CWE-770."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Resource exhaustion: Oscore b2 unbounded contexts. Categories: Resource exhaustion. Weaknesses: CWE-770.\n\n## Remediation\n\nDo not attach the duplicated context until the AEAD tag verifies, or explicitly free and unlink it on every decryption failure. Add a bound on the number of B.2 contexts and expire idle ones.",
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Oscore b2 unbounded contexts. Categories: Resource exhaustion. Weaknesses: CWE-770.\n\nRemediation:\n\nDo not attach the duplicated context until the AEAD tag verifies, or explicitly free and unlink it on every decryption failure. Add a bound on the number of B.2 contexts and expire idle ones."
              },
              "id": "resource-exhaustion.oscore-b2-unbounded-contexts",
